H34 (NEGATIVE) — SPXARCRANK: an arcane non-attack over an attack that ends the turn, ranked on what lands.
Census (3 seeds): Blaze card attacks printed 7.3 avg, landed 0.98 (0 of 100 landed in full); its arcane printed 3.4, landed 3.7.
Iyslander attacks landed 0.79 of 6.5, arcane 4.35. 76 Blaze / 95 Iyslander attack plays had an arcane card legal beside them.
Model: attack lands power - (3 x foe hand + foe gear defence); arcane lands arcane - judge.arcaneSoakOf(foe).
Fires: Aether Quickening played 12x in 96 Blaze games (was 1); Blaze card attacks 100 -> 30.
A/B 12 seeds, off -> on, 0 refusals / violations / stalls:
  Blaze     A 70 -> 56, B 66 -> 53  (136 -> 109 of 384)
  Iyslander A 68 -> 62, B 66 -> 54  (134 -> 116 of 384)
Why: a blocked attack is not wasted — the foe spends 2-3 hand cards on it, roughly its power's worth.
Variant ARCV=pow (attack valued at full power; arcane only when arcane - soak >= power): Iyslander 134 -> 133 (noise); Blaze never meets it.
Not shipped.

